 Ask the user for a caption, and collect it. Generate a properly oriented half-size version of the photo (using the Linux command-line convert program) When done, the program should leave the following in the directory in which it was invoked. (That is, if you were in foo/ when you invoked album, then all these things go into foo/) a file index.html containing, for each photo: a properly oriented thumbnail a caption a link from the thumbnail to a properly oriented medium-size version of the photo the thumbnails and medium-size versions.","topics":[],"score":190265,"global_rank":355708},{"name":"quinkennedy/flatmap","owner":"quinkennedy","html_url":"https://github.com/quinkennedy/flatmap","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Clojure","description":"an exploration of warping polylines into straight lines","topics":[],"score":190265,"global_rank":355709},{"name":"kklt92/HAproxy-proxy-protocol-parser","owner":"kklt92","html_url":"https://github.com/kklt92/HAproxy-proxy-protocol-parser","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Go","description":null,"topics":[],"score":190265,"global_rank":355710},{"name":"cptavatar/cz-parser","owner":"cptavatar","html_url":"https://github.com/cptavatar/cz-parser","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Clojure","description":"Just some clojure JSON parsing code to help do a bit more filtering out of vendor files I needed to look at. ","topics":[],"score":190265,"global_rank":355720},{"name":"TheRinger/em-control-box","owner":"TheRinger","html_url":"https://github.com/TheRinger/em-control-box","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"Electronic monitoring control box for commercial fisheries.","topics":[],"score":190265,"global_rank":355721},{"name":"aftab-hassan/pubmed","owner":"aftab-hassan","html_url":"https://github.com/aftab-hassan/pubmed","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":null,"topics":[],"score":190265,"global_